    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "并行堆 vacuum 补丁到 v20，回调移出表访问方法",
      "summary": "Bharath Rupireddy 提交了面向 PostgreSQL 20 的并行堆 vacuum v20。这一版主要回应 Andres Freund 的意见：并行 vacuum 的回调不该放进 table AM 接口，因为 vacuum 本身就是表访问方法内部的操作，于是改为通过 vacuumparallel.c 本地的回调结构体传递。补丁集精简为两个，一个重构堆扫描状态，另一个给 vacuum 第一阶段加并行支持。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/CALj2ACUMbUrcYzzbdSoPgsv+3kFdkGovDZe6aP3e6XQCzFqy9g@mail.gmail.com",
      "author": "Bharath Rupireddy",
      "source": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-07-17",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "VACUUM",
        "并行"
      ],
      "position": 3
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "relcache 缓存分区索引父 OID 让 TPS 提升三成",
      "summary": "Ayush Tiwari 提议在 relcache 里缓存分区索引的父 OID，减少 INSERT ... ON CONFLICT 在分区表上反复扫描 pg_inherits 的开销，v1 在热缓存下最高快 2.9 倍。Álvaro Herrera 建议改缓存完整祖先列表，但 pg_inherits 变更不触发 relcache 失效，索引重新挂载时会留下脏数据。v2 改为让整个后代索引子树失效，TPS 最高提升 31%。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/CAJTYsWUV3Tz5A161y2EcCMqnmCYqKNm6Jt=rXCx9bEOJ-hqL=A@mail.gmail.com",
      "author": "Ayush Tiwari",
      "source": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-07-17",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "relcache",
        "分区表",
        "性能"
      ],
      "position": 4
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "序列刷新的竞态将靠加锁根治，先回退相关提交",
      "summary": "commit f38afa4ab 带来一个竞态：sequencesync worker 还在运行时执行 ALTER SUBSCRIPTION ... REFRESH SEQUENCES 会报错，在 valgrind 的慢环境里，worker 因权限不足退出重启之后再执行就会失败。Tom Lane 质疑该提交的设计，认为应该在后端修而不是给测试打补丁。Amit Kapila 提出在 REFRESH 期间加 AccessExclusiveLock，并计划先回退这次提交。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/CALDaNm2mSAAjAX3d=E-XUXWZgVyy-dtcAhh+whe0a=6JTM0Bgg@mail.gmail.com",
      "author": "Amit Kapila",
      "source": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-07-17",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "逻辑复制",
        "序列",
        "回退"
      ],
      "position": 5
